# This repository vendors third-party pack sources verbatim. A pack snapshot is
# whatever upstream shipped, and the patch manifests count its files, so an
# ignore rule that drops one changes a manifest and fails a pinned test.
# Nothing under packs/ is safe to assume is junk.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored, though they are usual entries elsewhere:
#   dist/, scripts/  declared as `WEB_DIRECTORY` by four packs, which serve
#                    their frontend JS from them
#   .vscode/,        shipped by four packs; two of those live inside a `v2`
#   .idea/           tree, so the patch manifests count them
#   build/           absent today, and the same risk if a pack adopts it
#
# What remains is only what a machine writes locally and no pack ever ships.
# Verified against the tracked file list: none of these ever appeared in one.

# macOS / Windows
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp

# Written into the pack tree by importing it during conversion or testing
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.eslintcache
*.tsbuildinfo
